Subject: [PATCH 3/4] Harden the OAuth endpoints

Decode percent escapes without slicing text, so a multibyte character after a percent sign cannot panic. Send Cache-Control: no-store on token and registration responses. Refuse consent and revoke POSTs that have no matching Origin. Block framing of the consent page and show where the app will redirect.
